"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n<\/figure>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--dark-gradient s-band--spacious has-contrast-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-cta--fullbleed has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Right-sized HVAC for Media&#039;s unique microclimates<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Media&#039;s tree-lined streets create a beautiful environment, but they also create HVAC challenges that generic solutions can&#039;t address. The key is to size and design your system based on your specific lot conditions\u2014tree cover, sun exposure, window orientation\u2014rather than relying on averages or rules of thumb.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether that means a zoned mini-split system, a whole-house dehumidifier, or a modest oversize to account for future tree loss, the goal is a system that delivers comfort now and adapts to the conditions you&#039;ll face in the years ahead.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Book the Comfort Assessment<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+1\">Call Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"s-credits has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Photos: &quot;An o